# BuildKit reads this file instead of the repository-root .dockerignore when
# it builds driver/Dockerfile. The context is the repository root; the build
# reads only the root manifest (for the workspace fields ravel-object-store
# inherits), that crate, and this driver. rust-toolchain.toml stays out: the
# base image already pins the same toolchain.
*
!Cargo.toml
!crates/ravel-object-store/
!antithesis/store-contract/driver/
antithesis/store-contract/driver/target/
crates/ravel-object-store/target/
